== Notes ==
* {{Dlc|nr}}Poop spawned by The Hollow will never drop pickups, even when in possession of  {{t|Petrified Poop}}.
** {{Dlc|r}}Poops spawned by The Hollow have an incredibly low chance to spawn pickups. This chance is not affected by Petrified Poop.
** Leaving the room and returning will make the poop generate pickups normally.
* [[Piercing tears]] make fighting The Hollow much easier, as each tear can damage multiple segments.

== Trivia ==
* The Hollow was added in the ''Wrath of the Lamb'' DLC for the original ''The Binding of Isaac''.
* It is the posthumous version of {{e|Larry Jr.}}
* The definition of hollow is empty on the inside or surface, which could explain the boss's paleness and complexion.
* The Hollow is the only boss that has three Champion versions.
** In the [[V1.7.8]] update, The Hollow's yellow Champion version was given a unique sprite that looks similar to {{e|Ultra Greedier}}.
* The Hollow is the only regular boss that can be spawned by {{e|Mega Satan}} between thresholds.
* {{Dlc|r}} Despite {{E|Larry Jr.}} receiving new body sprites in ''Repentance'', and despite The Hollow's body sprites simply being recolors of Larry Jr.'s sprites, The Hollow's body sprites are unchanged in Repentance.

